dotnetdide

Based on the browser Roslyn compilation and assembly-loading approach demonstrated by
WasmSharp (JakeYallop), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://github.com/JakeYallop/WasmSharp
Reference commit: 2f8c93bfa39f2068ad932a748ba23f740075327c

This is a .NET-first adaptation, not an unmodified distribution of WasmSharp.
It replaces the TypeScript/Comlink/pnpm packaging with .NET projects, C# tests,
and a small dependency-free JavaScript loader/worker bridge. The persistent
submission chain and System.IO workspace API are implemented in this repository.

.NET and Roslyn are Microsoft/.NET Foundation projects distributed under their
respective licenses. NuGet dependency versions and transitive packages are recorded
in packages.lock.json files.
